                <head>[Enclosures.]</head>
                <p>1. Mr. Morse to Mr. Adams, July 13, 1865. </p>
                <p>2. Deposition of George Hall,(originally,) January 28, 1865. </p>
                <p>3. Deposition of Janies Davis, (originally,) March 13, 1865. </p>
                <p>4. Deposition of William Hall, (originally,) March 14, 1865. </p>
                <p>5. Deposition of Thomas Gibson, (originally,) April 4, 1865. </p>
                <p>6. Discharge of T. Gibson from rebel service. </p>
                <p>7. Deposition of John Morgan, (originally,) June 5, 1865.</p>










